230 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 145 0 R
/T (The data pins send out a raw Analog Voltage or a simple Digital High/Low signal based on gas levels, requiring no special communication protocols. The analog voltage smoothly rises as the air gets more polluted, while the digital pin acts as a simple on/off trigger switch when a specific gas threshold is crossed. We can tune the threshold by using the on board potentiometer. )
/E (The data pins send out a raw Analog Voltage or a simple Digital High/Low signal based on gas levels, requiring no special communication protocols. The analog voltage smoothly rises as the air gets more polluted, while the digital pin acts as a simple on/off trigger switch when a specific gas threshold is crossed. We can tune the threshold by using the on board potentiometer. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [28]
>>
endobj
