<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 146 0 R
/T (It works the same as the MQ-2 sensor. The data pins send out a raw Analog Voltage or a simple Digital High/Low signal based on gas levels, requiring no special communication protocols. The analog voltage smoothly rises as the air gets more polluted, while the digital pin acts as a simple on/off trigger switch when a specific gas threshold is crossed. We can tune the threshold by using the on-board potentiometer.)
/E (It works the same as the MQ-2 sensor. The data pins send out a raw Analog Voltage or a simple Digital High/Low signal based on gas levels, requiring no special communication protocols. The analog voltage smoothly rises as the air gets more polluted, while the digital pin acts as a simple on/off trigger switch when a specific gas threshold is crossed. We can tune the threshold by using the on-board potentiometer.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [29]
>>
