/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 148 0 R
/T (The data pin sends out a simple Digital High/Low signal based on infrared heat movement, requiring no special communication protocols. The digital pin acts as a simple on/off trigger switch that jumps to a steady 3.3V High signal when motion is detected, and drops back down to 0V Low when the area becomes still. We can tune the detection distance and the signal duration by using the onboard potentiometers.)
/E (The data pin sends out a simple Digital High/Low signal based on infrared heat movement, requiring no special communication protocols. The digital pin acts as a simple on/off trigger switch that jumps to a steady 3.3V High signal when motion is detected, and drops back down to 0V Low when the area becomes still. We can tune the detection distance and the signal duration by using the onboard potentiometers.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [27]
>>
