362 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 151 0 R
/E (The control side activates when a microcontroller sends a simple Digital High/Low signal to an external transistor, allowing current to flow through the relay's internal electromagnet coil and create a physical magnetic field. This magnetic field pulls an isolated internal metal arm away from its resting position, acting as an on/off mechanical trigger switch that safely bridges the gap to the separate power side. By shifting this arm, the high-voltage circuit alternates its path between the Normally Closed \(NC\) and Normally Open \(NO\) terminals, completely isolating the low-voltage logic components from dangerous high-power appliances.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [28]
>>
endobj
