423 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 154 0 R
/T (Receives a 50Hz PWM signal from an external controller, which it processes internally to determine the target position of its output shaft. Unlike raw DC motors, it relies on a specific timing protocol where the duration of a high-voltage pulse dictates the precise angle of rotation. We can use a library like the Arduino Servo.h library that implements this strict timing and background refresh protocol. Like DC motor the servo actuator can have stall current problem.)
/E (Receives a 50Hz PWM signal from an external controller, which it processes internally to determine the target position of its output shaft. Unlike raw DC motors, it relies on a specific timing protocol where the duration of a high-voltage pulse dictates the precise angle of rotation. We can use a library like the Arduino Servo.h library that implements this strict timing and background refresh protocol. Like DC motor the servo actuator can have stall current problem.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
