/Title (The data pins send out a raw Analog Voltage or a simple Digital High/Low signal based on gas levels, requiring no special communication protocols. The analog voltage smoothly rises as the air gets more polluted, while the digital pin acts as a simple on/off trigger switch when a specific gas threshold is crossed. We can tune the threshold by using the on board potentiometer.)
