/Title (Only accepts raw electrical power and cannot process digital data signals. To control the shaft's rotations per minute \(RPM\), an external device must directly regulate the power delivered from the external power source to the motor. Components like a MOSFET transistor or a motor driver module act as high-speed electronic switches controlled by a microcontroller using PWM)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1597 0 R
/First 1619 0 R
